{"2290520": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sneaky Pirates", "steam_appid": 2290520, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set sail in <i>Sneaky Pirates!</i> A thrilling online multiplayer social deduction game where deception, strategy, and fast-paced action collide on the open sea! In this high-stakes battle of wits, up to <strong>4 players</strong> disguise themselves among a fleet of ships, sneaking around while trying to <strong>hunt down and steal from their rivals</strong>—all without being caught.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290520/extras/29d94fb5d073368c5b65263a5fca08a9.avif?t=1750285283\" width=616 height=126 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💰 <strong>Steal to Win</strong> – The pirate with the most gold at the end of the match reigns supreme. In case of a tie, the first one to steal claims victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290520/extras/f3044951518184a5c0bd3b51ceeb3261.avif?t=1750285283\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290520/extras_big/f3044951518184a5c0bd3b51ceeb3261.avif?t=1750285283 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕵️ <strong>Hide in the crowd </strong>– Blend into a sea of AI-controlled ships, carefully plotting your next move while staying unnoticed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290520/extras/a53777e5e5825072f1867e1235a23512.avif?t=1750285283\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290520/extras_big/a53777e5e5825072f1867e1235a23512.avif?t=1750285283 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️ <strong>Power Up or Fight Back</strong> – Use special abilities to escape tight situations, throw off pursuers, or strike down other pirates!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290520/extras/e77f9276d4fb501c96fded2a2085c2d9.avif?t=1750285283\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290520/extras_big/e77f9276d4fb501c96fded2a2085c2d9.avif?t=1750285283 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎨 <strong>Customize Your Ship</strong> – Buy and equip aesthetic upgrades to make your vessel truly yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290520/extras/0490cf0db065f325f451b488098eb945.avif?t=1750285283\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290520/extras_big/0490cf0db065f325f451b488098eb945.avif?t=1750285283 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎭 <strong>Choose Your Playstyle</strong> – Stay hidden and play it safe, or throw caution out the window and steal recklessly—both approaches can lead to victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⏳ <strong>No Winner is Safe</strong> – The tides can turn at any moment—a last-second, well-placed steal can change everything!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌊 <strong>Evolving Early Access</strong> – The adventure is just beginning! We’re looking forward to expand <i>Sneaky Pirates</i> with new content and features, shaped by community feedback.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to deceive, steal, and outsmart other pirates? Join the crew and prove you're the craftiest on the seven seas! 🏴‍☠️</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290520/extras/ca6b99c3c8393cfe34a8690638d7f353.avif?t=1750285283\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290520/extras_big/ca6b99c3c8393cfe34a8690638d7f353.avif?t=1750285283 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set sail in <i>Sneaky Pirates!</i> A thrilling online multiplayer social deduction game where deception, strategy, and fast-paced action collide on the open sea! In this high-stakes battle of wits, up to <strong>4 players</strong> disguise themselves among a fleet of ships, sneaking around while trying to <strong>hunt down and steal from their rivals</strong>—all without being caught.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290520/extras/29d94fb5d073368c5b65263a5fca08a9.avif?t=1750285283\" width=616 height=126 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💰 <strong>Steal to Win</strong> – The pirate with the most gold at the end of the match reigns supreme. In case of a tie, the first one to steal claims victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290520/extras/f3044951518184a5c0bd3b51ceeb3261.avif?t=1750285283\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290520/extras_big/f3044951518184a5c0bd3b51ceeb3261.avif?t=1750285283 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕵️ <strong>Hide in the crowd </strong>– Blend into a sea of AI-controlled ships, carefully plotting your next move while staying unnoticed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290520/extras/a53777e5e5825072f1867e1235a23512.avif?t=1750285283\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290520/extras_big/a53777e5e5825072f1867e1235a23512.avif?t=1750285283 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️ <strong>Power Up or Fight Back</strong> – Use special abilities to escape tight situations, throw off pursuers, or strike down other pirates!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290520/extras/e77f9276d4fb501c96fded2a2085c2d9.avif?t=1750285283\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290520/extras_big/e77f9276d4fb501c96fded2a2085c2d9.avif?t=1750285283 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎨 <strong>Customize Your Ship</strong> – Buy and equip aesthetic upgrades to make your vessel truly yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290520/extras/0490cf0db065f325f451b488098eb945.avif?t=1750285283\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290520/extras_big/0490cf0db065f325f451b488098eb945.avif?t=1750285283 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎭 <strong>Choose Your Playstyle</strong> – Stay hidden and play it safe, or throw caution out the window and steal recklessly—both approaches can lead to victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⏳ <strong>No Winner is Safe</strong> – The tides can turn at any moment—a last-second, well-placed steal can change everything!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌊 <strong>Evolving Early Access</strong> – The adventure is just beginning! We’re looking forward to expand <i>Sneaky Pirates</i> with new content and features, shaped by community feedback.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to deceive, steal, and outsmart other pirates? Join the crew and prove you're the craftiest on the seven seas! 🏴‍☠️</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290520/extras/ca6b99c3c8393cfe34a8690638d7f353.avif?t=1750285283\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290520/extras_big/ca6b99c3c8393cfe34a8690638d7f353.avif?t=1750285283 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Sneaky Pirates is a fast-paced online multiplayer social deduction game for 4 players. Hide among ships, steal from rivals, and use power-ups to escape or fight back. Play it safe or go all-in—no winner is safe until the last second! Customize your ship and be the king of pirates! 🏴‍☠️", "supported_languages": "English, Spanish - Spain", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290520/header.jpg?t=1750285283", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290520/9692bdfdce5469d023c7a8ad01bc09ca4f91081a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750285283", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290520/9692bdfdce5469d023c7a8ad01bc09ca4f91081a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750285283", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or higher<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core 2.4 ghz 64 bits<br></li><li